      "id": "teach_5",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Fractions obey the same BODMAS queue:\n\n3/4 + 5/6 × 4/5\n\nMultiplication first:\n\n5/6 × 4/5 = 20/30 = 2/3\n\nThen the addition:\n\n3/4 + 2/3 = 9/12 + 8/12 = 17/12 = 1 5/12",
