      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "A fraction can sit on top of another fraction:\n\n(2/3) / (5/6)\n\nThe long middle bar is the real division sign. It means:\n\n2/3 ÷ 5/6\n= 2/3 × 6/5\n= 12/15\n= 4/5",
